  "source_pdf": "downloads/pigsys-boing-boing-band-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7d01786d5aa2e48b5a03e76cc525c690ef9627c8e2a0c50fc7a837d2f919028c",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "edb8f6840c2e6f762fdb86566b803b0d2e94cb6732b5e80cf0eebb4663ef7447",
      "text": "八戒的\n嗡嗡音乐会",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ac976148c0dd63601f7bf1f9924e2f469c1fabf8e1daba5ff5172ea705fd31ab",
      "text": "八戒用一个大纸盒做了只青蛙，\n肚子圆滚滚的。\n八戒说：“青蛙一定要会‘嗡’\n一声！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "54409940dcad64f0801268723223791522f0873c265ae0244cdfdfd4b8d34a45",
      "text": "沙僧来帮忙，\n把两根宽宽的橡皮筋绷在青\n蛙嘴上。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "851c59218a2a85d59ed59b0f05d6ad26b80800bb1fb3ebc6a1dbd7252b025976",
      "text": "悟空拨了一下橡皮筋。\n“嗡——”青蛙唱起来了。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6bac4e14e44f88742c21f3d991adb8867ae884af4490515e155a270d0974f5f9",
      "text": "他按住橡皮筋，想再拨一次——\n声音没了！\n“小青蛙，你怎么不唱了？”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a591928d652e67b3ff4a9a1fcb3fa81a24bd28159e08415ebafa4131b9c02f8c",
      "text": "八戒拍拍青蛙：\n“小青蛙，你是不是困了？”\n青蛙一声也不吭。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "db2c2813e86dd4c590a5859a7544735841192f9686b02b5525525b1583fac520",
      "text": "哪吒想到一个办法：\n“我们边看边听。\n再拨一次，盯着橡皮筋看。”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a7366535ae4e96da7b674a75e2e6ecff6360de462823d04f40cfc3f4aaeab496",
      "text": "“嗡——”橡皮筋抖得飞快，看得\n人眼都花了。\n哪吒说：“它在振动，\n声音就是这么来的。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a9cf805f586cfe5f09c13bfd8f24768b45452306c2eaa11847b4b4a8f2e5b942",
      "text": "悟空按住橡皮筋，\n橡皮筋不振动了，\n声音也停了。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2b2c499c6d4a09a2c5b01fa1d3c7ca8d10a950534dd48b345c572f69e808fd33",
      "text": "八戒拨一下，再摸摸纸盒。\n嗡嗡嗡，手心能感觉到它在抖。\n八戒说：“好痒呀！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e8366fe3a78be0555c8e703a9dbb94731089ec2486bdb783da0d9c1598b3fedc",
      "text": "这次，两根一起拨。\n“嗡——嗡——”\n悟空按住其中一根，\n就只剩下一个声音了。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1e27b128672d32b7745d12bcfae2c337394b4cb81c418929c69041dadbc2a12d",
      "text": "悟空说：“橡皮筋一抖，就‘嗡—\n—’！\n橡皮筋不动，就没声音！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c1be6f4e6b172960110a7371dc0b754cb117ffbb4dca8ab44433757249a4c1d",
      "text": "八戒想开一场又大又响的\n音乐会，\n伸手就要使劲拉橡皮筋。\n沙僧说：“轻轻拨，\n小青蛙喜欢小声唱。”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cfe5251aaffc6747effae46a1e1b5be5cbd9abf7151dfb5a6c52c50c3ba02014",
      "text": "八戒拨一根，哪吒拨另一根。\n悟空一喊“停！”，\n大家就按住橡皮筋。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8fdd7acf8fab3042d35da9d960acea433b20edac3a58de0b890f7ad42fd56644",
      "text": "“嗡，嗡……停！”\n“嗡……停！”\n一首轻轻的小曲子。\n沙僧轻轻地鼓掌。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fe242e5c27bb0d420c344b684210b2e7e8339e4e31ec44c20535c6353bafacc9",
      "text": "八戒向青蛙鞠了一躬，\n肚子“咕噜”叫了一声。\n悟空说：“又一个新声音！”\n八戒说：“该吃点心啦！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
